  "sketch": "// Force Sensor (FSR): voltage divider with 10kΩ resistor\n// Pin 1 -> 5V, Pin 2 -> A0 and 10kΩ to GND\nconst int sensorPin = A0;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  Serial.begin(9600);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  int reading = analogRead(sensorPin);\n  float voltage = reading * 5.0 / 1023.0;\n  float resistance = (5.0 - voltage) * 10000.0 / voltage;\n  float force = 10000.0 / resistance; // approximate\n  \n  Serial.print(\"Force: \");\n  Serial.print(force, 2);\n  Serial.println(\" N (approx)\");\n  delay(200);\n}\n",
